I'll start us off here. How do you generally see

01:06:28.745 --> 01:06:32.360
municipalities funding these kinds of projects, whether it's

01:06:32.860 --> 01:06:34.766
a vertiport or runway?

01:06:36.115 --> 01:06:40.263
So what are the, like, the financial dynamics? We'll go into

01:06:40.763 --> 01:06:43.949
a little more detail on that in our next session. Okay. But there's any number

01:06:44.449 --> 01:06:48.244
of opportunities. It can be— one of the primary goals

01:06:48.292 --> 01:06:51.641
is to become listed as a

01:06:51.705 --> 01:06:55.776
NIPPIUS airport. That opens the door for federal funding for

01:06:55.792 --> 01:07:00.038
certain facilities. We speak of colors of money in

01:07:00.538 --> 01:07:04.205
the industry because each type of fund that you receive can be

01:07:04.221 --> 01:07:07.933
