01:07:08.061 --> 01:07:12.176
on when it can be used, how it can be used, what facilities it's eligible

01:07:12.676 --> 01:07:16.047
for. But third-party opportunities,

01:07:16.160 --> 01:07:20.191
there may be investors who want to

01:07:20.691 --> 01:07:23.275
develop facilities. Mm-hmm. I've talked to schools,

01:07:24.459 --> 01:07:28.953
aviation schools that would be interested in developing facilities within

01:07:29.001 --> 01:07:32.593
Utah. Eagle Mountain City might be an ideal

01:07:33.093 --> 01:07:36.511
