01:07:40.897 --> 01:07:44.218
itself is typically funded by the community,

01:07:44.251 --> 01:07:46.868
by the airport. Initially, when you're looking at this,

01:07:47.157 --> 01:07:51.444
since you don't have a revenue stream, you're going to be looking at possibly using

01:07:52.022 --> 01:07:55.410
