02:28:08.253 --> 02:28:11.907
Not quite there, but almost. I got on the phone with Mare

02:28:12.407 --> 02:28:14.606
and I said, yeah, I'm with Advancement. And she goes, well, I want to start

02:28:15.106 --> 02:28:17.471
this scholarship. And I And I said, okay, okay. And then she says— I said,

02:28:17.519 --> 02:28:20.804
