02:29:31.052 --> 02:29:34.195
we're also doing an expendable scholarship.

02:29:34.549 --> 02:29:37.390
What's that? that will be available as soon as we have the money that we

02:29:37.890 --> 02:29:40.809
can give out while that builds. So again,

02:29:41.242 --> 02:29:44.870
if you see the website here, it is— if you just Google USU

02:29:45.255 --> 02:29:49.092
Ta'Dae Black Wildlife, this webpage will come up. And you can donate directly

02:29:49.188 --> 02:29:52.270
