02:36:04.872 --> 02:36:07.816
to the wildlife corridor. So Yeah, Brett's going to read the resolution.

02:36:09.898 --> 02:36:12.699
A resolution of Eagle Mountain City, Utah, designating the Todd A.

02:36:12.894 --> 02:36:16.197
Black Memorial Wildlife Corridor in honor of Todd A. Black and his

02:36:16.294 --> 02:36:19.884
contributions to wildlife conservation. Whereas Eagle Mountain

02:36:19.916 --> 02:36:23.502
City recognizes the importance of protecting wildlife habitat,

02:36:23.872 --> 02:36:28.010
migration routes, and open spaces for current and future generations,

02:36:28.269 --> 02:36:31.897
and whereas Todd A. Black served Eagle Mountain City

02:36:31.913 --> 02:36:36.113
as wildlife biologist and open space manager, dedicating his knowledge

02:36:36.145 --> 02:36:40.278
and passion to wildlife conservation and the preservation of natural resources.

02:36:40.695 --> 02:36:44.316
And whereas Todd played an instrumental role in identifying and

02:36:44.816 --> 02:36:47.969
protecting wildlife migration routes, advancing habitat preservation,

02:36:48.562 --> 02:36:51.702
and promoting responsible stewardship of Eagle Mountain's natural

02:36:52.202 --> 02:36:55.531
environment. And whereas the City Council desires to honor

02:36:56.031 --> 02:36:59.456
Todd A. Black's service and lasting contribution to the community by

02:36:59.956 --> 02:37:03.622
recognizing his legacy through the naming of the city's wildlife corridor.

02:37:04.504 --> 02:37:07.840
Now therefore be it resolved by the City Council of Eagle Mountain City,

02:37:07.936 --> 02:37:11.657
Utah, the Eagle Mountain City Council hereby designates

02:37:12.041 --> 02:37:15.810
the, the Eagle Mountain Wildlife Migration Corridor as the

02:37:16.310 --> 02:37:19.626
Todd A. Black Memorial Wildlife Corridor in

02:37:19.723 --> 02:37:23.507
recognition of Todd's dedication and contributions to wildlife conservation

02:37:24.007 --> 02:37:27.276
and habitat preservation. The city reaffirms its commitment to

02:37:27.776 --> 02:37:31.190
protecting wildlife habitat and migration routes. and ensure

02:37:31.690 --> 02:37:35.718
Todd's legacy of conservation continues to benefit future generations.

02:37:36.248 --> 02:37:39.202
City staff are authorized to update applicable city records,

02:37:39.234 --> 02:37:42.976
maps, and public references to reflect this designation.

02:37:43.650 --> 02:37:46.990
This resolution shall become effective immediately upon adoption,

02:37:47.504 --> 02:37:50.811
and it's about to be adopted. It will be adopted by the City Council

02:37:51.311 --> 02:37:54.569
of Eagle Mountain this 17th day of November, 2026.

